flowchart LR
    A[Input Features] --> B[Bootstrap Sampling<br/>draw many random training subsets]
    B --> C[Train Many Decision Trees]
    C --> D[Random Feature Subsets<br/>each split considers only part of the feature space]
    D --> E[Individual Tree Predictions]
    E --> F[Aggregate Predictions]
    F --> G[Classification: majority vote<br/>or averaged class probability]
    G --> H[Final Prediction]

    I[Why it works<br/>reduces overfitting by combining diverse trees] --> F